<title>UK: Banco Itau sets $100 million three-year bond.</title>
<headline>Banco Itau sets $100 million three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Bankers Trust International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANCO ITAU</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	COUPON     **	  MATURITY    11.JUL.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    11.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.40	REOFFER    **	  SPREAD    +130-140 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 MGT/UND    0.10	SELL CONC   0.40</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    UK	  DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK/BR</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.375 PCT MAY 2000 U.S TREASURY -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
